      "parameters": {
        "width": 820,
        "height": 240,
        "content": "## Independent review event receiver | Section 6\nAutomatic and manual decisions use the same entry. Header credential is required. Reload the authoritative event, current final status and immutable snapshot reference from Python; never authorize export from webhook fields.\n\nHTTP 202 means accepted, not processed. Excel and result notification are added in the next step. Accepted/failed/unknown events can be explicitly replayed with the same event ID, up to five deliveries. No automatic loop. The Compose external hook excludes the authentication header from serialized execution data; disabling execution saving alone is insufficient. Bind AP review event local header and install the hook before activating on another instance."
